module main

// T537 QA round 1 adversarial probe (F1/F2 seams the engineer probe does not reach): an immutable `static` whose
// type contains an `@lang("atomic")` struct is interior-mutable storage (placed in `.data`/`.bss`), so
//   * a shared borrow of it records EFFECT_WRITES_MEM in the call-graph summary (`cg_local_is_atomic_static`);
//   * alias analysis classifies it as DOMAIN_GLOBAL_STATIC with escaped/raw-exposed provenance, never
//     DOMAIN_CONST_RDATA;
// while a plain immutable scalar `static` stays DOMAIN_CONST_RDATA and its readers stay read-only (no WRITES_MEM).

